   "text": "mock: seeded data, no network.\nlive: Composio + Parallel +\nSlack.\ndemo: live first, recorded reads\nif a call fails or times out;\nwrites are never faked.\ndemo-offline: recorded reads,\nsimulated writes (tagged).",
   "originalText": "mock: seeded data, no network.\nlive: Composio + Parallel +\nSlack.\ndemo: live first, recorded reads\nif a call fails or times out;\nwrites are never faked.\ndemo-offline: recorded reads,\nsimulated writes (tagged).",
